  _category: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8b7b72a809a05de42b9e4e1a9fc3d116, type: 2}
  _glyph: "\U0001F33D\uFE0F"
  _subtitle: Hopes for brains
  _description: Stuffed with straw and set up in a [[2fba8332-0d5e-4efb-baa5-1817978f32f5|Scarecrow's
    Cornfield]] to frighten the crows, who were not frightened at all. [[fcbf3650-903d-4ed3-a6f8-79e222116920|Dorothy
    Gale]] lifts him off his pole, and he joins her to ask the Wizard for [[72d53f5e-227f-43cc-82e0-17bc929d3982|Brains]].
    Later he rules the [[7d7db0c4-2516-4f3e-9975-1c9765bdffb8|Emerald City]].
  _sortOrder: 2
